/* Settings: Skins */
"Skins" = "皮肤";
"Built In" = "内置";
"Your Skins" = "你的皮肤";
"No skins of your own yet." = "还没有你自己的皮肤。";
"A skin is a folder with idle.png, and optionally blink.png and hit.png (or numbered sequences like blink-1.png, blink-2.png), its own mallet.png and impact.png, and skin.json for its name, where the mallet lands, and its knock: wood, lacquer, ink, cartoon, pixel, jade, bowl, key, bamboo, stone, piston, crt, bead, plate, porcelain, bell, stamp, chime, board, or ceramic. A single image works too, and so does a .plinthskin file, a skin folder zipped to share. Right-click a skin of your own to export one." = "皮肤是一个文件夹，必须有 idle.png。眨眼和被敲中的画面可以放 blink.png、hit.png，也可以是 blink-1.png、blink-2.png 这样的编号序列；还可以带自己的 mallet.png 和 impact.png，再用 skin.json 写上名字、锤子的落点，以及敲击声：wood、lacquer、ink、cartoon、pixel、jade、bowl、key、bamboo、stone、piston、crt、bead、plate、porcelain、bell、stamp、chime、board、ceramic。单独一张图片也能当皮肤，.plinthskin 文件也行，它就是打包成一个文件、方便分享的皮肤文件夹。右键点你自己的皮肤，可以把它导出成 .plinthskin。";
"Choose images, skin folders that contain idle.png, or .plinthskin files" = "选择图片、包含 idle.png 的皮肤文件夹，或 .plinthskin 文件";

